  "summary": "The J8 header shared by every 40-pin Raspberry Pi, from the Model B+ through the Pi 5. Names are BCM numbers, which is what libgpiod, pigpio and the Python GPIO libraries expect. The alternate functions listed are the BCM283x / BCM2711 ones; the Pi 5 routes the header through its RP1 chip, which has a different function table.",
